---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const contactEmail = import.meta.env.PUBLIC_CONTACT_EMAIL || 'hello@poteto.fun';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy — Poteto Daily Human Audit"
  description="Poteto collects zero personal information—only an anonymous browser UUID and tiny 0-100 vector stroke arrays."
  canonicalPath="/privacy"
>
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-2xl px-4 py-10 sm:px-6">
    <div class="rounded-3xl border border-[#E4E4E7] bg-white p-6 shadow-xs sm:p-10">
      <span class="font-mono text-xs font-bold tracking-wider text-[#71717A] uppercase">
        PRIVACY POLICY · EFFECTIVE NOV 2026
      </span>
      <h1 class="mt-2 font-display text-2xl font-extrabold text-[#09090B] sm:text-3xl">
        Privacy Policy
      </h1>

      <div class="mt-6 space-y-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-[#3F3F46]">
        <p>
          Poteto (&ldquo;we&rdquo;, &ldquo;the site&rdquo;) is designed with strict zero-login privacy. We do not offer account registration and never collect your name, email address, phone number, or precise location.
        </p>

        <h2 class="pt-2 font-display text-base font-bold text-[#09090B]">1. What We Store</h2>
        <ul class="list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-5">
          <li><strong>Browser Storage (localStorage)</strong>: A randomly generated anonymous <code>client_id</code> (UUID), your daily score history, streak count, mute setting, and reminder preference. Clearing browser data resets all of it immediately.</li>
          <li><strong>Vector Sketches</strong>: When you submit a Stage 3 doodle, we store only the normalized 0–100 coordinate array (no images, no EXIF metadata) linked to your anonymous UUID so you can see how many humans your potato fooled the next day.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="pt-2 font-display text-base font-bold text-[#09090B]">2. Takedowns &amp; Deletion</h2>
        <p>
          Community sketches pass automated geometric rules, next-day curation, and 3-flag automatic removal. To request manual removal of a sketch, email us with the UTC date at{' '}
          <a href={`mailto:${contactEmail}`} class="font-mono font-semibold text-[#1A73E8] underline">
            {contactEmail}
          </a>
          .
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
